                    <p><strong>&#128204; TL;DR - LLP Name Change in Delhi Services at a Glance</strong></p>
                    <p>Change name under S.19 LLP Act: (1) Partner consent + resolution, (2) RUN-LLP name reservation (Rs 200, valid 3 months), (3) Form 5 within 30 days, (4) Fresh Certificate of Incorporation, (5) Supplementary Agreement + Form 3 within 30 days, (6) Post-change: PAN, TAN, GST, banks, contracts, letterheads. LLPIN unchanged. Must end with "LLP". Late: Rs 100/day. Patron manages from Delhi.</p>
                </div>
                <p>Delhi LLPs change names for rebranding, strategic pivots, dropping departed partner names, or ROC/CG direction. LLPIN stays same — only name changes. Learn more about <a href="/llp-name-change">LLP Name Change across India</a>.</p>
